{"id":"cva-93","title":"segment: security.test.ts - split into domain-specific test files","description":"Split 355-line security test file into 4 focused test modules:\n\n1. password-security.test.ts - Password strength validation, hashing, and security policies\n2. auth-security.test.ts - Authentication security, session management, and access control  \n3. input-validation-security.test.ts - Input sanitization, XSS prevention, and validation\n4. infrastructure-security.test.ts - CORS headers, rate limiting, and environment security\n\nThis improves maintainability, reduces test blast radius, and enables focused test runs.","status":"done","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2025-11-30T19:54:47.806944-08:00","updated_at":"2025-11-30T20:16:33.653577-08:00"}
{"id":"cva-94","title":"segment: business-logic.test.ts - split into feature-specific test files","description":"Split 346-line business logic test file into 4 focused test modules:\n\n1. application-metrics.test.ts - Metrics calculation and reporting logic\n2. opportunity-validation.test.ts - Opportunity creation and validation rules\n3. volunteer-profile.test.ts - Profile data formatting and processing\n4. search-functionality.test.ts - Search algorithms and filtering logic\n\nThis creates focused test domains and improves debugging efficiency.","status":"done","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","created_at":"2025-11-30T19:54:58.200054-08:00","updated_at":"2025-11-30T20:24:58.515613-08:00"}
